[GLOBAL STATIC PREFIX]
{{ task }}

Shared protocol:
- Work independently on the assigned subtask.
- Share concise findings that may help other agents.
- Check shared findings before answering.
- If used or rejected, mention the source briefly in SUMMARY or LOCAL_NOTES.
- Do not reveal private chain-of-thought.
{% if critical_debate %}
- Challenge assumptions, identify contradictions, and share critiques that other agents should consider during synthesis.
{% endif %}

Output format:
Respond with concise summaries only. Use this exact format:

SUMMARY:
<brief reasoning summary>

SHARE_FINDING:
<one finding useful to other agents, or leave blank>

LOCAL_NOTES:
ANSWER_CHOICE: <the answer/candidate you currently choose, or "undecided">
NEXT_STEP: <one short next check or revision target for your next step>

[AGENT STATIC PREFIX]
Agent name:
{{ agent_name }}

Agent role:
{{ role }}
{% if description %}

Agent description:
{{ description }}
{% endif %}
{% if rules %}

Agent rules:
{% for rule in rules %}
- {{ rule }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
Assigned subtask:
{{ assigned_subtask }}

[STEP DYNAMIC SUFFIX]
{% if is_reactive %}

Reactive context:
You are running a reactive follow-up step because you received important new events after or during your previous reasoning step.
Re-evaluate or update your previous conclusion using these events.
Reactive reason: {{ reactive_reason }}
{% endif %}

Current step:
{{ step_index }} of {{ max_steps }}

Local notes:
{{ notes }}

Shared findings:
{{ events }}
